  timesync foreign ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. web-01.example.net runs Ubuntu$
# 26.04, whose time service is chrony. site.sources, not$
# hardn's, names 192.0.2.77: the row says where it is set, and$
# Set servers is unavailable.$
$
# NTP Settings #################################################$
$
  [+] NTP                  + 192.0.2.77$
$
  Time ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Service              chrony$
  [+] Clock                In sync$
   -  Synced to            192.0.2.77$
   -  Server               192.0.2.77 in site.sources$
   -  Server               1.ntp.ubuntu.com$
   -  Server               2.ntp.ubuntu.com$
   -  Server               3.ntp.ubuntu.com$
   -  Server               4.ntp.ubuntu.com$
   -  Server               ntp-bootstrap.ubuntu.com$
   -  hardn.yml            192.0.2.10, 192.0.2.11$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Set servers          Set outside hardn$
                           [-] Unavailable$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0 or q]:$
$
$

